<p>Creates a circle of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> at your feet; the circle lights up affected tiles, increases your positive energy by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> each turn and deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">8.18, 11, 13, 15, 17</acronym> light damage and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">8.18, 11, 13, 15, 17</acronym> fire damage per turn to everyone else within its radius.  The circle lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>